(6742167, 1008983, 71489, '<td valign="top">The yellow tulips are softer than the leaves there which <b>in my opinion</b> should''ve been the other way round since your subject are the yellow tulips. Also, the vase shifted to a little right would''ve perfectly centered the composition.</td>', 'The yellow tulips are softer than the leaves there which in my opinion should''ve been the other way round since your subject are the yellow tulips. Also, the vase shifted to a little right would''ve perfectly centered the composition.', '2012-04-15 12:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742170, 1008620, 71489, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting :) Is it just me or do you think a darker background would''ve really upped the contrast and your jar would''ve looked more golden?</td>', 'Looks like a painting :) Is it just me or do you think a darker background would''ve really upped the contrast and your jar would''ve looked more golden?', '2012-04-15 12:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
