(6742274, 1008604, 109363, '<td valign="top">disturbing</td>', 'disturbing', '2012-04-15 15:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742358, 1008517, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting attempt, and there are things I like about it. The pieces look quite interesting -- I''d love to see them closer in. The chess volume 2 is interesting. But there are many issues that are getting in my way. The blown highlights on the corner of the book, the chair (is it a chair?) on the left, the back corner of the board being cut off. (this, imo, is a case of either cropping it in closer to make it an obvious artistic choice, or getting the whole thing. Right now it looks like more of an oversight.)<br/> <br/>Plus, I think the biggest problem is that yellow is more of a background color in this shot than an important part of the overall composition.<br/> <br/>(voted earlier)</td>', 'It''s an interesting attempt, and there are things I like about it. The pieces look quite interesting -- I''d love to see them closer in. The chess volume 2 is interesting. But there are many issues that are getting in my way. The blown highlights on the corner of the book, the chair (is it a chair?) on the left, the back corner of the board being cut off. (this, imo, is a case of either cropping it in closer to make it an obvious artistic choice, or getting the whole thing. Right now it looks like more of an oversight.) Plus, I think the biggest problem is that yellow is more of a background color in this shot than an important part of the overall composition. (voted earlier)', '2012-04-15 18:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742362, 1008875, 103142, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea of this, but the processing isn''t working for me. It seems under exposed and there''s halos around the left. I like the blinds and the composition -- I think with a high key treatment it could be light and airy and fresh. (voted earlier)</td>', 'I really like the idea of this, but the processing isn''t working for me. It seems under exposed and there''s halos around the left. I like the blinds and the composition -- I think with a high key treatment it could be light and airy and fresh. (voted earlier)', '2012-04-15 18:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742363, 1008147, 103142, '<td valign="top">It looks like this shot is under exposed, and ends up looking a little flat and dingy. I think if you brightened it a bit and added some more contrast that it would improve it quite a bit.</td>', 'It looks like this shot is under exposed, and ends up looking a little flat and dingy. I think if you brightened it a bit and added some more contrast that it would improve it quite a bit.', '2012-04-15 18:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742368, 1008423, 103142, '<td valign="top">Have you viewed this on other screens? On my screen it appears quite underexposed. It could use quite a bit of brightening and a little more contrast, imo. (voted earlier)</td>', 'Have you viewed this on other screens? On my screen it appears quite underexposed. It could use quite a bit of brightening and a little more contrast, imo. (voted earlier)', '2012-04-15 18:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742369, 1008996, 103142, '<td valign="top">This looks underexposed. I think if you brightened it quite a bit and played with the contrast, it would improve it. (voted earlier)</td>', 'This looks underexposed. I think if you brightened it quite a bit and played with the contrast, it would improve it. (voted earlier)', '2012-04-15 18:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742376, 1008810, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is really an interesting cactus. It looks a little underexposed, and I''d be curious what it would look like shot at a lower angle. I know we''d lose the inside of the flower, but it might make the background a bit more interesting. (voted earlier)</td>', 'This is really an interesting cactus. It looks a little underexposed, and I''d be curious what it would look like shot at a lower angle. I know we''d lose the inside of the flower, but it might make the background a bit more interesting. (voted earlier)', '2012-04-15 18:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742398, 1008424, 120171, '<td valign="top">Nothing flash just good old use of light. I hope this is on the front in the morning. 10</td>', 'Nothing flash just good old use of light. I hope this is on the front in the morning. 10', '2012-04-15 18:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6742399, 1008048, 120171, '<td valign="top">Never enough... I can remember (just about) the times ive had too much!<br/>Simple and elegant shot. The only thing that i dont like is the harsh highlight on the bottles waterline. 9</td>', 'Never enough... I can remember (just about) the times ive had too much!Simple and elegant shot. The only thing that i dont like is the harsh highlight on the bottles waterline. 9', '2012-04-15 18:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
