(6742408, 1008091, 120171, '<td valign="top">Really cool idea which is visually striking but you also have a lot of dust captured within the image. The dust for me takes away from what should be a clean crisp shot.</td>', 'Really cool idea which is visually striking but you also have a lot of dust captured within the image. The dust for me takes away from what should be a clean crisp shot.', '2012-04-15 19:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
