(6743756, 1008887, 109227, '<td valign="top">I like this one.  I, too, got comments on my entry about being too busy and still did fairly well.  Traditional still life usually has many elements to it.  Nice placement.</td>', 'I like this one.  I, too, got comments on my entry about being too busy and still did fairly well.  Traditional still life usually has many elements to it.  Nice placement.', '2012-04-16 19:22:12.000000', NULL, 0),
