(6743781, 1008244, 109227, '<td valign="top">Anita, thanks for the nice comment on my entry.  I have been away and not able to vote or comment on this challenge, but this one is so pretty; love the softness.  Glad it made the top 10.</td>', 'Anita, thanks for the nice comment on my entry.  I have been away and not able to vote or comment on this challenge, but this one is so pretty; love the softness.  Glad it made the top 10.', '2012-04-16 19:47:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6743838, 1008771, 113900, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually care much for still lifes but I like this one a lot.  Having not read the comments yet I will guess that a lot of people didn''t care for the shadow.  I like the shadow.  To me the shadow makes it somehow tangible.  <br/> <br/>Good shot.</td>', 'I don''t usually care much for still lifes but I like this one a lot.  Having not read the comments yet I will guess that a lot of people didn''t care for the shadow.  I like the shadow.  To me the shadow makes it somehow tangible.   Good shot.', '2012-04-16 20:59:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6743936, 1009007, 66384, '<td valign="top">Marion, I really like this and gave it an 8. The simplicity, and the composition are very artistic. A little on the orange side, but still qualifies as yellow in my book. Too bad about missing the 6. :(</td>', 'Marion, I really like this and gave it an 8. The simplicity, and the composition are very artistic. A little on the orange side, but still qualifies as yellow in my book. Too bad about missing the 6. :(', '2012-04-16 22:57:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(6743953, 1008620, 66384, '<td valign="top">I think with that nice interesting background, the arrowhead pendant is a little too much -- often ''less is more''. :) The pot is very well setup, and could easily stand alone. All said, I think the color hurt your score more than anything else - a nice color but a bit DNMC.</td>', 'I think with that nice interesting background, the arrowhead pendant is a little too much -- often ''less is more''. :) The pot is very well setup, and could easily stand alone. All said, I think the color hurt your score more than anything else - a nice color but a bit DNMC.', '2012-04-16 23:07:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6743979, 1008620, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOVE the background in this.</td>', 'LOVE the background in this.', '2012-04-16 23:30:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6744003, 1008620, 68504, '<td valign="top">I liked and like this rather a lot.  The tones and textures work richly for me.  I would like to know what is the arrow thingee.</td>', 'I liked and like this rather a lot.  The tones and textures work richly for me.  I would like to know what is the arrow thingee.', '2012-04-17 00:05:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(6744107, 1008620, 97225, '<td valign="top">I gave you an 8 for this Alice. It''s very artistic and I really like it. Btw you beat me by .007<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-04-17 01:05:52.</i></td>', 'I gave you an 8 for this Alice. It''s very artistic and I really like it. Btw you beat me by .007', '2012-04-17 02:02:35.000000', '2012-04-17 02:05:52.000000', 0),
