(6744662, 1008988, 94815, '<td valign="top">Incredible! ...and the orange is why I didn''t rate it higher. I still gave you a 6 and feel this is one of the two most underrated in the challenge. Beautifully creative tonality.</td>', 'Incredible! ...and the orange is why I didn''t rate it higher. I still gave you a 6 and feel this is one of the two most underrated in the challenge. Beautifully creative tonality.', '2012-04-17 17:58:28.000000', NULL, 0),
